{
 "segments": [
  {
   "start": 0.0,
   "end": 2.22,
   "text": "Henry, you're now getting into the mistakes"
  },
  {
   "start": 2.22,
   "end": 4.02,
   "text": "and you have an eye for it."
  },
  {
   "start": 4.28,
   "end": 7.24,
   "text": "So keep in mind, the first day I bought FHA, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.6,
   "end": 8.24,
   "text": "30 year financing."
  },
  {
   "start": 8.92,
   "end": 9.9,
   "text": "And I'm like, okay, this is smooth."
  },
  {
   "start": 10.4,
   "end": 12.24,
   "text": "When I was running these numbers up front"
  },
  {
   "start": 12.24,
   "end": 14.3,
   "text": "and this is really green of me, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 14.44,
   "end": 15.6,
   "text": "Having listened to all these podcasts,"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.02,
   "end": 18.08,
   "text": "I was running it on a 30 year note."
  },
  {
   "start": 18.28,
   "end": 19.62,
   "text": "I'm like, these are three quadplexes."
  },
  {
   "start": 19.68,
   "end": 20.98,
   "text": "It's gonna be 30 year, this is great."
  },
  {
   "start": 21.6,
   "end": 23.12,
   "text": "And then I get hit with the realization"
  },
  {
   "start": 23.12,
   "end": 25.06,
   "text": "as we're getting past due diligence,"
  },
  {
   "start": 25.3,
   "end": 26.76,
   "text": "this is a commercial loan."
  },
  {
   "start": 27.16,
   "end": 28.32,
   "text": "I've never done a commercial loan."
  },
  {
   "start": 28.32,
   "end": 29.08,
   "text": "20 year am."
  },
  {
   "start": 29.18,
   "end": 31.78,
   "text": "It's 20 year am, that changes the numbers significantly."
  },
  {
   "start": 32.06,
   "end": 33.66,
   "text": "I'm like, hold up, this is completely different, right?"
  },
  {
   "start": 34.78,
   "end": 36.64,
   "text": "And it's like a five year balloon"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.64,
   "end": 39.2,
   "text": "to where, hey, you've got to either refinance"
  },
  {
   "start": 39.2,
   "end": 42.06,
   "text": "or you got to sell this thing five years from now."
  },
  {
   "start": 42.16,
   "end": 43.92,
   "text": "So that completely changed up the numbers."
  },
  {
   "start": 44.18,
   "end": 45.68,
   "text": "And I warn a lot of people of that now,"
  },
  {
   "start": 45.82,
   "end": 47.2,
   "text": "like, hey, commercial's different."
  },
  {
   "start": 47.48,
   "end": 48.64,
   "text": "That five year you're looking at"
  },
  {
   "start": 48.64,
   "end": 50.38,
   "text": "versus the fourplex are not the same."
  }
 ],
